      "Fingersticks were taken at clinical times (often around meals), not at random moments.",
      "Glucose meters have their own error (ISO 15197 allows \u00b115 %), so this is CGM-meter disagreement, not the CGM's true error.",
      "Applies to the Shanghai sensors only; the other datasets use different CGM devices and have no reference readings."
    ]
  }
